## Deployment Instructions

### To Deploy These Flows:

1. **Access Power Automate**
   - Go to make.powerautomate.com
   - Select your environment

2. **Create Each Flow**
   - Go to "New flow"
   - Select flow type (Cloud flow > Scheduled/Automated/Instant)
   - Configure trigger
   - Add actions from specifications above
   - Configure error handling
   - Save and test

3. **Testing**
   - Trigger flow manually
   - Verify all actions execute
   - Check email delivery
   - Validate Teams notifications
   - Monitor error logs

4. **Activation**
   - Turn flow "On"
   - Monitor for 1 week
   - Make adjustments based on logs
   - Document any customizations

